he MPS debugger when paraphrasing the MPL(B) introduction. The separate MPL(B) bibliography entry links the original print. The direct historical page and its printed date govern the reviewed claim.","mesa-editions":"May 1978 Version 4.0 and April 1979 Version 5.0 are separate Xerox language source records. The October 1976 early-users report describes scoped observed usage and the dated Alto system collection gives a separate system context.","mps-and-mpl":"The September 4, 1972 MPS 11.0 cover identifies Xerox PARC and Stanford Research Institute. The February 25, 1974 MPL(B) print identifies the named Xerox language iteration for MAXC and PDP-10. These materials support bounded historical distinctions and no broad identity or compatibility merge."},"source_commit":"54202ec1363505cc8d1be732def8df6d476c7c1c","supplemental_acquisitions":{"completed_at":"2026-11-23T15:58:58.937+00:00","results":[{"bytes":19116440,"completed_at":"2026-11-23T15:58:42.697+00:00","content_type":"application/pdf","etag":"\"123b198-493a64565db40\"","expected_match":true,"expected_sha256":"a56321b15aefcf38147096fbb0761109645ddd026618c11fe5c6e2696d620282","final_url":"https://bitsavers.org/pdf/xerox/mesa/4.0_1978/Mesa_4_Documentation/Mesa_Language_Manual_Version_4.0_May78.pdf","http_status":200,"id":"mesa-v4-catalog-route","last_modified":"Thu, 28 Oct 2010 05:04:05 GMT","locator":"https://bitsavers.org/pdf/xerox/mesa/4.0_1978/Mesa_4_Documentation/Mesa_Language_Manual_Version_4.0_May78.pdf","sha256":"a56321b15aefcf38147096fbb0761109645ddd026618c11fe5c6e2696d620282","started_at":"2026-11-23T15:58:41.676+00:00","suffix":"pdf"},{"completed_at":"2026-11-23T15:58:58.936+00:00","error":"<urlopen error timed out>","expected_sha256":null,"id":"mesa-v5-alternate-chm","locator":"https://bitsavers.computerhistory.org/pdf/xerox/parc/techReports/CSL-79-3_Mesa_Language_Manual_Version_5.0.pdf","started_at":"2026-11-23T15:58:41.677+00:00"},{"bytes":10261698,"completed_at":"2026-11-23T15:58:42.829+00:00","cont